Neon Self-hosted Control Plane
Managed Auth integrates Better Auth 1.7.7 (MIT) and node-postgres 8.23.1 (MIT).
Sources: https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth and https://github.com/brianc/node-postgres.
Installed dependency packages retain their upstream license notices.
Copyright 2026 the control-plane contributors.

This independent project integrates with Neon open source components.
Neon and PostgreSQL source repositories and container images retain their own
licenses and notices. They are external deployment dependencies, not relicensed
by this repository. No ownership of Neon names or marks is asserted.

Go module dependencies are declared in api/go.mod and api/go.sum.
Web dependencies are declared in web/package.json and web/package-lock.json.
Container CI emits per-image SBOM and build provenance. Operators must review
dependency licenses and security advisories for their own distribution.

The control-postgrest image redistributes the digest-verified official PostgREST
16.4 executable under its upstream MIT license. The unmodified notice from
https://github.com/PostgREST/postgrest/blob/v16.4/LICENSE is retained in
third_party/licenses/PostgREST-16.4-MIT.txt and copied into that image at
/usr/share/licenses/postgrest/LICENSE. Apache-2.0 applies to this control plane's
own source, not to the upstream PostgREST executable or its dependencies.
